      "prompt": "Brand new original ECLIPSE videogame art generated ONLY from this written brief. Ultra-wide 3:1 landscape. Strict orthographic side elevation for a pixel side scroller. Authored-looking low resolution pixel art at roughly 360x120 pixel density: broad deliberate stepped clusters, crisp silhouette, sparse highlights, restrained blue charcoal palette with one accent. Never a painterly illustration. No people, monsters, interface, lettering, logos, framing or borders. Void corridor. Oppressive subterranean nave. Slabs of black masonry pulled apart sideways by an eerie violet seam. Sparse cold reflected light from the impossible fissure, ribbed vaults and deep shadow. Keep the lower band quiet. This is ONLY the rear scenery layer, cropped wall continues to lower edge, no walkable platforms in this plate.",
